The reviewers' concerns can be summarized as follows:
1. Poor In-domain Performance (Reviewer AEG4, BmY1, ZmfZ);
2. Questionable Validity of the Prior (Reviewer AEG4, ZmfZ);
3. Limited Novelty (Reviewer BmY1);
4. Generalizability (Reviewer BmY1, ZmfZ, 8Ps7);
5. Need to demonstrate the effectiveness of point cloud super-resolution on downstream tasks. (8Ps7).
